{"id":"obsta_culo","lemma":"obstáculo","pos":"noun","rank":4179,"glosses":["obstacle, hindrance, stumbling block, hurdle, barrier, impediment, obstruction, handicap, constraint, snag, bottleneck (something immaterial that hinders progress)","obstacle (something physically hindering progress)","hurdle"],"ipa":"/obsˈtakulo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"obstáculos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-obst%C3%A1culo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hubo un obstáculo.","en":"There was a hitch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448928","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Hay otro obstáculo.","en":"There's another hitch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460975","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"someone else"},null]},{"text":"Seguimos adelante a pesar de los obstáculos.","en":"We pushed ahead despite the obstacles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693278","words":[{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"forward"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[2,5,"in spite of, despite"]]},{"text":"Él enfrentó obstáculos imprevistos.","en":"He encountered unexpected obstacles.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to confront, to face","l":"enfrentar"},null,{"g":"unforeseen","l":"imprevisto"}]},{"text":"Yo considero a los obstáculos como un desafío.","en":"I see obstacles as challenges.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65078","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to consider","l":"considerar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"challenge"}]}]}